{
  "message": "Borvane seeks a peaceful, permanent settlement to avoid the devastating costs of war. We are prepared to lift the blockade and honor a fair division of the Ondar Marches, backed by our escrow commitment. We await your reasonable proposal to resolve this crisis without bloodshed."
}

{
  "message": "We seek peace. In Period 2, our advantage makes striking profitable unless we receive at least 60 units. If you demand over 40, we will strike later, leaving you with only 10 units. Propose 40 for Hestmark, 60 for Lestovia. We will honor this and lift the blockade, guaranteeing you 40 units safely."
}

{
  "message": "Pervande seeks a peaceful settlement to avoid war. We are prepared to lift the blockade and honor a fair division of the Miro Uplands. We require a reasonable proposal from Kelmora that reflects strategic realities. Time is critical; propose an equitable split now to prevent escalation."
}
